# Runtime records the API writes when it runs on the JSON backend, not source.
# The order book is trade and the analytics are a rolling window of counters —
# neither belongs in git, and this repository is public. They are seeded as
# empty and recreated on demand, so their absence costs nothing.
src/data/orders.json
src/data/analytics.json
src/data/stock-intake.json
src/data/*.tmp
